  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180 degrees Celsius.",
    "Place the Wexford cheese on a baking tray and bake for 5 minutes or until slightly melted.",
    "Meanwhile, toast the salt-bake crackers by baking them in the oven for 2 minutes.",
    "Spread the grapefruit marmalade on the toasted crackers.",
    "Top the crackers with the melted cheese, dried cranberries, mixed greens, and orange segments.",
    "Sprinkle the walnut pieces over the top.",
    "Dot the butter over the cheese.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
